---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 碎碎念
description: 零散的笔记、小小的想法，还有没写完的念头。
section: ramblings
feedUrl: /ramblings/feed.xml
feedTitle: 碎碎念
pagination:
  data: collections.ramblings
  size: 12
  reverse: true
  alias: pagedRamblings
  generatePageOnEmptyData: true
permalink: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}/ramblings/{% else %}/ramblings/page/{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/{% endif %}"
---

<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-3">碎碎念</h1>
<p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
  零散的笔记、小小的想法，还有没写完的念头。
</p>

{% if pagedRamblings.length %}
  <ul class="space-y-6">
    {% for rambling in pagedRamblings %}
      <li>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          <time datetime="{{ rambling.date | isoDate }}">{{ rambling.date | readableDate }}</time>
          {% if rambling.data.updated %}
            &middot; Updated: <time datetime="{{ rambling.data.updated | isoDate }}">{{ rambling.data.updated | readableDate }}</time>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <a href="{{ rambling.url }}" class="text-xl font-semibold hover:underline">{{ rambling.data.title }}</a>
        {% if rambling.data.description %}
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-1">{{ rambling.data.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <p class="text-gray-500">这里暂时还没有碎碎念。</p>
{% endif %}

{% if pagination.pages.length > 1 %}
  <nav class="mt-8 flex gap-4 text-sm" aria-label="碎碎念分页">
    {% if pagination.href.previous %}
      <a href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}" class="border border-gray-200 px-3 py-1 hover:bg-gray-50">&laquo; 更新的</a>
    {% endif %}
    {% if pagination.href.next %}
      <a href="{{ pagination.href.next }}" class="border border-gray-200 px-3 py-1 hover:bg-gray-50">更早的 &raquo;</a>
    {% endif %}
  </nav>
{% endif %}
